{
  "$schema": "../../../../packages/shared/schema/animation-scene.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "c-02-facade",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Facade: Dört Alt Sistem, Tek Çağrı",
    "en": "Facade: Four Subsystems, One Call"
  },
  "summary": {
    "tr": "Controller yalnızca CheckoutFacade.placeOrder çağırır; facade stok ayırır, ödeme alır, kargo planlar ve bildirim gönderir; hata olursa telafi eder.",
    "en": "The controller only calls CheckoutFacade.placeOrder; the facade reserves stock, charges, schedules shipping and notifies; on failure it compensates."
  },
  "a11y": {
    "description": {
      "tr": "Solda OrderController, ortada CheckoutFacade, sağda üstten alta Inventory, Payments, Shipping ve Notification alt sistemleri. Controller placeOrder çağırır; facade sırayla dört alt sistemi çağırır ve tek bir OrderId döner.",
      "en": "OrderController on the left, CheckoutFacade in the middle, Inventory, Payments, Shipping and Notification subsystems stacked on the right. The controller calls placeOrder; the facade calls the four subsystems in order and returns a single OrderId."
    }
  },
  "canvas": {
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 600
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "client",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "OrderController",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 170,
      "h": 70,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "HTTP katmanı",
        "en": "HTTP layer"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "facade",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "CheckoutFacade",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 200,
      "h": 80,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "placeOrder(cart, card)",
        "en": "placeOrder(cart, card)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "inv",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "InventoryService",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 90,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 56
    },
    {
      "id": "pay",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "PaymentGateway",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 230,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 56
    },
    {
      "id": "ship",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "ShippingService",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 370,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 56
    },
    {
      "id": "notif",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "NotificationService",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 510,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 56
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "c-f",
      "from": "client",
      "to": "facade",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "placeOrder()"
    },
    {
      "id": "f-inv",
      "from": "facade",
      "to": "inv",
      "kind": "request",
      "curvature": -0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "f-pay",
      "from": "facade",
      "to": "pay",
      "kind": "request"
    },
    {
      "id": "f-ship",
      "from": "facade",
      "to": "ship",
      "kind": "request"
    },
    {
      "id": "f-notif",
      "from": "facade",
      "to": "notif",
      "kind": "request",
      "curvature": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "call",
      "title": {
        "tr": "1. Tek giriş noktası",
        "en": "1. A single entry point"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Controller dört servisin sırasını, parametre dönüşümlerini ve hata telafisini bilmek zorunda değildir. Yalnızca facade.placeOrder(cart, card) çağırır.",
        "en": "The controller does not need to know the order of four services, parameter conversions or failure compensation. It only calls facade.placeOrder(cart, card)."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "inherit": false,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "client",
          "facade"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "c-f"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "facade": {
          "status": "active"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {},
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "c-f",
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "placeOrder()",
          "durationMs": 1000
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "id": "a1",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 420,
          "text": {
            "tr": "controller 1 bağımlılık bilir, 4 değil",
            "en": "controller knows 1 dependency, not 4"
          },
          "target": "client"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "orchestrate",
      "title": {
        "tr": "2. Facade alt sistemleri sırayla çağırır",
        "en": "2. The facade calls the subsystems in order"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Stok ayrılır, kart çekilir, kargo planlanır. Sıra ve parametre eşlemesi facade'ın içindedir; facade iş kuralı içermez, yalnızca koordine eder.",
        "en": "Stock is reserved, the card is charged, shipping is scheduled. The order and parameter mapping live inside the facade; the facade holds no business rules, it only coordinates."
      },
      "durationMs": 4500,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "inv",
          "pay",
          "ship"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "f-inv",
          "f-pay",
          "f-ship"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "inv": {
          "status": "success",
          "badge": "reserved"
        },
        "pay": {
          "status": "success",
          "badge": "charged"
        },
        "ship": {
          "status": "success",
          "badge": "scheduled"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {},
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "f-inv",
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "reserve()",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "f-pay",
          "startAt": 1000,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "charge()",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "f-ship",
          "startAt": 2000,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "schedule()",
          "durationMs": 800
        }
      ],
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "notify",
      "title": {
        "tr": "3. Bildirim ve tek sonuç",
        "en": "3. Notification and a single result"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Son olarak bildirim gönderilir ve controller'a tek bir OrderId döner. Facade, alt sistemlere doğrudan erişimi yasaklamaz; yalnızca en sık senaryoyu paketler. Raporlama ekibi InventoryService'i hâlâ doğrudan kullanabilir.",
        "en": "Finally a notification is sent and a single OrderId returns to the controller. The facade does not forbid direct access to subsystems; it just packages the most common scenario. The reporting team can still use InventoryService directly."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "notif",
          "client"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "f-notif",
          "c-f"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "notif": {
          "status": "success"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {},
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "f-notif",
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "orderConfirmed()",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "c-f",
          "startAt": 1000,
          "direction": "backward",
          "color": "success",
          "label": "OrderId",
          "durationMs": 800
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "id": "a3",
          "x": 460,
          "y": 170,
          "text": {
            "tr": "facade koordine eder, iş kuralı barındırmaz",
            "en": "the facade coordinates, it holds no business rules"
          },
          "tone": "info",
          "target": "facade"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "failure",
      "title": {
        "tr": "4. Hata: facade telafi eder",
        "en": "4. Failure: the facade compensates"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Kargo planlama başarısız olursa facade ödemeyi iade eder ve stoğu serbest bırakır; controller yalnızca anlamlı bir hata görür. Bu akış büyürse facade bir saga orchestrator'a dönüşür (b-02).",
        "en": "If shipping scheduling fails, the facade refunds the payment and releases the stock; the controller sees only a meaningful error. When this flow grows, the facade turns into a saga orchestrator (b-02)."
      },
      "durationMs": 4500,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "ship",
          "pay",
          "inv"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "f-ship",
          "f-pay",
          "f-inv"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "ship": {
          "status": "error",
          "badge": "failed"
        },
        "pay": {
          "status": "warning",
          "badge": "refunded"
        },
        "inv": {
          "status": "warning",
          "badge": "released"
        },
        "notif": {
          "status": "idle"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {},
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "f-ship",
          "direction": "backward",
          "color": "danger",
          "label": "error",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "f-pay",
          "startAt": 900,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "color": "warning",
          "label": "refund()",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "f-inv",
          "startAt": 1800,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "color": "warning",
          "label": "release()",
          "durationMs": 800
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "id": "a4",
          "x": 460,
          "y": 440,
          "text": {
            "tr": "telafi mantığı tek yerde",
            "en": "compensation logic in one place"
          },
          "tone": "warning",
          "target": "facade"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
